    "title": "Rock the Plains will come to Tuttle Creek State Park - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Manhattan\nRock the Plains will come to Tuttle Creek State Park\n3 hours ago\nThe two-day country music festival Rock the Plains will be held at Tuttle Creek State Park Friday and Saturday. It will feature Texas red dirt country music. Executive Producer Brandyn Steen noted that he and the other co-founders are K-State graduates who had experienced Country Stampede which used to be located at Tuttle Creek State Park, \"Wanted to bring back an environment where those memories could be made.\"",
